title: Stage a file, stage all, unstage the new file, commit: git log must have 'steps only' with src/steps.rs alone, new_file.rs stays untracked, then a commit with nothing staged only says so
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/.git/logs/HEAD :: ^(?![\s\S]*nothing is staged)[\s\S]*commit: steps only
expect-file: git-changes/src/new_file.rs :: fresh
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
git stage src/steps.rs
wait 1200
mark staged-one
wait 500
git stage
wait 1200
mark staged-all
wait 500
git unstage src/new_file.rs
wait 1200
git commit steps only
wait 1500
mark committed
wait 500
git commit nothing is staged now
wait 1500
mark nothing
wait 500
git unstage
wait 1000
quit
